    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>description</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1661 characters\">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;b&gt;Product Overview&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Premium MAK 80W SuperVOOC Fast Charger adapter built for rapid and dependable mobile device charging. Clean White compact body made with fire-retardant polycarbonate material for a safe durable build. Delivers powerful 80W output with 6A current for fast charging that fully charges compatible devices in just 39 minutes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Key Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&#8226; Superfast Warp Charge technology delivers 80W maximum power for the fastest possible charging speed&lt;br&gt;&#8226; Supports multiple charging protocols including SuperVOOC, VOOC, FLASH, DART, and WRAP charging&lt;br&gt;&#8226; 3 layers of built-in protection guard against over-current, over-voltage, and short-circuit damage&lt;br&gt;&#8226; Over-charge and over-heat protection ensures the battery and device remain safe during long sessions&lt;br&gt;&#8226; BIS certified adapter ensures quality, safety, and compliance with all Indian regulatory requirements&lt;br&gt;&#8226; Universal voltage support of 100-240V AC makes it safe for use across all countries and power grids&lt;br&gt;&#8226; Charges devices 3 times faster than regular standard wall chargers for significantly reduced wait times&lt;br&gt;&#8226; Compact lightweight adapter-only design allows use with any preferred Type-C fast charging cable&lt;br&gt;&#8226; Ideal for Mobile, Tablet, Laptop, and PC charging with its broad and versatile device compatibility&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Why Buy This&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Output interface of DC 5V at 6A ensures stable and efficient power delivery to all connected devices. 6 months replacement warranty included for reliable after-sales support and buyer peace of mind. Over-discharge protection extends battery longevity by preventing harmful deep discharge cycles.&lt;/blockquote&gt;</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>short_description</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"200 characters\">Premium MAK 80W SuperVOOC Fast Charger adapter built for rapid and dependable mobile device charging. Clean White compact body made with fire-retardant polycarbonate material for a safe durable build.</span>\"
